     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Hi Guido,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Validating items is more art than science. The more you use these statistics you will notice that very often they will reject perfectly fine/acceptable items. It is also very common to have conflicting diagnostics depending on the stats you use. Use them all and use them as a heads-up for you to look for adjustments issues but I would not recommend  using them to reject items. All plot the curves and check adjustments. Use itemplot profusely!! ;-)</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">This list has many threads that will recommend such an approach. </div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Regards,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Hugo</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">Em sex., 29 de out. de 2021 às 09:39, Guido &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">guido.l....@gmail.com</a>&gt; escreveu:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">Hello,<div><br></div><div>Does anyone have references on which rules of thumb apply for interpreting the Yen Q3 statistic? I have heard that values &gt; .37 are considered large but I can&#39;t seem to find references to back this up.</div><div><br></div><div>Thx,</div><div><br></div><div>Guido</div><div> </div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;mirt-package&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mirt-package...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/mirt-package/51ac6f6d-9632-416d-92b7-c0dc301b448en%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/mirt-package/51ac6f6d-9632-416d-92b7-c0dc301b448en%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471483769000&amp;usg=AOvVaw28UMi6DQyzf9Y1HEo0OHdx\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/mirt-package/51ac6f6d-9632-416d-92b7-c0dc301b448en%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\n</blockquote></div><br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div><br><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-size:medium\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"10\"><p style=\"margin-right:10px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:14px\"><a href=\"http://www.adaptativa.com.br/\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.adaptativa.com.br/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471483770000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1mCEZ_6gbshOcDkMerB5zQ\"><img src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/FE2I4wjFnN2cAFKRmI3TKMszOlSp21wnNu4SqBeCJZBTRvT_FvrlgmwCaxvFTesKdXjysxxb7nvH4if6T_hi884vh3N59BHtgm3-wqx9bgkcnTo-Jw1Bg01c1Tk3qGCKYDUC3lEyIIXfgYCyCshNyEk3Ee8Wg4ibOcS9FfxhtyTI=s0-d-e1-ft#https://htmlsigs.s3.amazonaws.com/logos/files/000/177/391/landscape/adaptativa_256px80pxL_72dpi_SEM_SLO